[{"title":"旅火","author":"钱时","text":"湖边车马日提壶，有眼何曾识野蔬。\n肯为饥羸忘肉味，孰云医国世间无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61974,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留仲谦","author":"钱时","text":"二十年前旧诗友，子居仲谦真耐久。\n少时怀抱易过逢，老去云林难聚首。\n去年广塾得子居，论心岂但相煦濡。\n咫尺仲谦招不得，有园日涉将毋娱。\n风吹原头动春色，招携肯为山翁出。\n恰恰子居来日来，岿然暮展遥天碧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61975,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蚕妇叹","author":"钱时","text":"蚕妇拂蚕叶如缕，爱之何啻珠玉比。\n呼奴勤向帐前看，夜卧靡宁三四起。\n未必便能丝挂体，眷焉于怀有真喜。\n人人办得此时心，推而广之岂不美。\n以此事君定忠臣，以此事父定孝子。\n以此事夫定贤妇，一念真成转枢耳。\n嗟哉世人胡不然，三纲茫茫不如蚕一纸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袁尚右座中王屯田出与可竹甚奇归成古调","author":"钱时","text":"郎星聚头金地麓，十月夜堂春昱昱。\n屯田博古到名画，座上忽展牛腰束。\n我生不识须菩提，薛鹤杨梅姑置之。\n寒梢八幅奇更伟，上有巴中与可题。\n苍蛟滑走石诘曲，铁钩怒扫联蛇腹。\n攲风洒雨清逼人，恍疑身在筼筜谷。\n十寻双干剑拔雄，笔力有尽意无穷。\n冥冥上与风霆会，拭目变化洪陂龙。\n长忆东坡一转语，与可德人非画史。\n轮囷写出岁寒心，政要诸公相料理。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书灯","author":"钱时","text":"读书灯，明暳暳，溪堂故人亲送似。\n历落平生未见书，与汝间关几半世。\n几年来，味无味，并与青编共捐弃。\n半身沦落浙江濆，壁角破圈尘没鼻。\n新春忽尔思起废，顷刻工夫依前具。\n提入山翁结草庐，永夜虚窗照天地。\n圣教衰，异端炽，千古冥行士何事。\n人人有此大光明，埋没荒唐渺漫处。\n象山翁，天启秘，嫡嗣慈湖更超诣。\n陋儒俗学破沉痾，暗室迷途逢宝炬。\n读书灯，明一切，不是山翁爱文字。\n逢人若问伏羲前，灯下齁齁方瞌睡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"钱时","text":"世上纷纷竞奇巧，人人自巧不知宝。\n此巧本不属思为，妙质融融复皓皓。\n天地万象罗其中，纵横变化无时穷。\n珠璧隐现光错落，丹青组织花珑葱。\n有时六出不停剪，有时柔茵铺地遍。\n有时飞空调羽商，嘈杂间关声百啭。\n千态万状难形容，欲著一语迷西东。\n宣尼但说不可见，后学强名造化工。\n我欲从渠问谁造，不觉低头发长笑。\n且不可见那可言，春秋冬夏无非教。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"钱时","text":"醯鸡瓮藏眼，鼹鼠河满腹。\n啄木头铿敲，蜗牛角出缩。\n君不见浩浩无边春，出门面面皆交亲。\n未到地灵地，安知人杰人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔浦夜雪怀季扬","author":"钱时","text":"季扬欲我来山阴，季思欲我归严陵。\n严陵山阴两无住，来去于我如浮云。\n飞雪漫漫浙江暮，朔风吹船渔浦渡。\n咫尺不到兴有馀，底须夜出山阴路。\n东华尘土缁人衣，顾瞻禹穴何巍巍。\n克艰一言万世师，季扬季扬何时归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜诸子所和诗盟歌俱有可采再用韵见意","author":"钱时","text":"蛮触封疆日勍敌，金丹不疗膏肓疾。\n抖擞风埃发诗骨，参差头角崭然出。\n老夫所志在大雅，诸子政须勤帝籍。\n三叹变风我心恻，箾韶忍受淫哇屈。\n岂不见渭川千亩拂云长，前日手栽数寸碧。\n苟得其养终巨世，勿玩流光生厌射。\n世间浅者无远识，如兽系足鸟摧翼。\n伯乐眼空冀北群，汤鼎坐吊淮南虱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游齐山仓使遣赠长歌和韵","author":"钱时","text":"昔来阳未复，倏忽今大壮。\n颇复怀兹游，山山日环乡。\n雪多春较涩，寒力花难王。\n晨兴起和羹，御风飒然往。\n嵌空互出奇，峭立屹相并。\n应接不暇瞬，跬步即异状。\n明游俱可人，心惬有馀况。\n寄隐定何许，醒翁本无相。\n浑浑太古前，此巧岂天匠。\n天亦莫能名，谁欤实开创。\n妙空与上清，可笑渠汝诳。\n绣春最孤绝，势压翠微上。\n一带抹长江，群雉拱千嶂。\n超览妙无涯，天地入吾量。\n畴能事劖镌，琐琐较真妄。\n所乏者古木，无木更虚旷。\n蛮触战封疆，鸡虫争得丧。\n坐缚万古痴，无病自生恙。\n好是两忘猜，不劳费监谤。\n载弄阳春曲，万汇同盎盎。\n长歌卷雪腴，颇恨阻搜访。\n此事属臞仙，公勿多怊怅。\n东山挂游屐，皇猷赖公畅。\n玉堂深复深，夜植青藜杖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登蜀阜二首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"宝货秋毫归润屋，锥刀左计属痴儿。\n独馀风月无人管，合著山亭顿放伊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新晴","author":"钱时","text":"宿云穿日薄，商略作新晴。\n燕子先期社，海棠今日春。\n溪山双白鬓，天地一闲身。\n无语东风里，飞花乱扑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"稚女谈命有感","author":"钱时","text":"韩将军出金鎗班，调官挈家来西山。\n嗟哉厉鬼不汝贷，一妻二女何间关。\n失身醉仙漫糊口，不知命落醉仙手。\n娇少年才十二三，敲金便着红尘走。\n忆昔干戈多乱离，草间公卿儿女啼。\n但愿吾皇有道守四夷，未消琐琐且为将军悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜀阜精庐无风自凉方欣然出户见竹鸡将雏砌外","author":"钱时","text":"薝卜净如洗，苍筤清且深。\n依岩自幽润，况无日影侵。\n亭午一升阶，忽若投凌阴。\n凉气飒以入，肃肃生衣襟。\n大火浮炎埃，虚堂抱云林。\n安得冰霜颜，听我山中吟。\n盘桓去未忍，砌外行山禽。\n一母将四雏，出没丛草阴。\n我非有驯德，渠自无机心。\n欣然归北窗，载弄南风琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮山","author":"钱时","text":"断雨暂提苍玉出，游云忽捲画图归。\n须臾变态无穷妙，更著双双白鹭飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端忞疲于哺蚕老妇悯而饷之余作古调以赞之","author":"钱时","text":"族孙买叶中山归，恻然闻之矜尔疲。\n长腰豚蹄亟送似，未暇问到而蚕饥。\n此时此念难藏假，厩焚退朝遑恤马。\n马非不爱爱我人，用违其才终土苴。\n试问母今蚕几筐，间关未必能补疮。\n我亦有蚕非条桑，他日天机云锦裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"管湖马上","author":"钱时","text":"去年跨马西湖曲，画船歌管声相逐。\n诸友联辔俱绝俗，敲镫微吟山水绿。\n今年跨马管家湖，山花欲动山禽呼。\n安得诸友复联辔，如许野趣苏堤无。\n野趣野翁心自可，未必行人总宜我。\n尔不宜我柰尔何，春风满袖谁当歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"精庐枕上","author":"钱时","text":"山隐夜来山月好，幽香满地开花草。\n竹梢堕露鸣屋瓴，谷鸟一声报清晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横途归路","author":"钱时","text":"山花荣，山禽鸣，绿杨碧涧声泠泠。\n此时山翁寻故人，笋舆伊轧兮度密穿青，且行且止兮草软沙平。\n溪云山雨相送迎，冲口而出我诗成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题方大夫家训","author":"钱时","text":"中兴天子方御戎，长城万里张魏公。\n此时此家尽好武，抵掌一呼来幕中。\n幕中群雄肝胆烈，指顾关河日弹铗。\n若为岁晚归课儿，只说读书兴农业。\n定知万事俱弗如，岂直鎗剑输毛锥。\n君不见二十七年耕草庐，出师一表汗青书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"篙师叹","author":"钱时","text":"山乡山多田种稀，年丰健妇犹啼饥。\n今年禾黍秋旱死，不有下涧民枯鱼。\n颇闻水乡诸郡熟，一饱可令馀郡足。\n江船下米无头由，商人嗷嗷坐穷蹙。\n长年抱膝指屡弹，时节自好官司难。\n古来邻国忍为壑，何乃境内成触蛮。\n我闻斯言真的当，无人为彻九天上。\n禁江徒尔厄吾民，海舶有时关节放。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠日者","author":"钱时","text":"世上痴儿爱官职，买山不作千金惜。\n乌囊费尽铁鞋穿，近在方寸人不识。\n公卿将相无时无，安得生贤为楷模。\n嵩岳降神尼毓圣，此倘有地君其图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠墨工","author":"钱时","text":"客来投我一点漆，快汲清泉洗端石。\n晴窗净几试一挥，错落精神光照日。\n如此妙质奇复奇，变化纵横随所施。\n可怜自有不自宝，日用纷纷谁得知。\n愿言莫染荒唐辞，亦莫随俗供妍媸。\n杂学支离二千载，汗牛充栋终何为。\n由来此物自神圣，妙不可言那可尽。\n分明宇宙在毫端，万古糊涂人不信。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"顾野王读书堆","author":"钱良臣","text":"伊昔边烽备不虞，太平移作梵王居。\n而今江表全无事，借我三椽更读书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋新繁周表权如诏亭","author":"钱咏","text":"选构人皆事宴逢，独君教子袭良弓。\n因闻诗礼家题旧，及宠丝纶语命同。\n几杖已尊贤老外，龟鱼争焕綵衣中。\n新来更喜增荣观，青锁才臣赠古风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游铁岸","author":"钱昆","text":"晴红烟绿衬虚亭，公退因来得野情。\n落日东风懒归去，拟将薄禄换溪声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题淮阴侯庙","author":"黄好谦","text":"筑坛拜日恩虽重，蹑足封时虑已深。\n隆准早知同鸟喙，将军应起五湖心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿延庆院","author":"钱昆","text":"水绕门墙竹绕堂，满窗春绿更山光。\n坐来苔藓侵衣润，吟处松花落砚香。\n汀鹭双双翻乱石，溪风袅袅弄修篁。\n游人暂得幽闲趣，时带茶烟下上方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹亭","author":"钱明逸","text":"千里波平瑟瑟风，纤云不解翳虚空。\n素娥自有清光在，上下清明一鉴中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"习家池大堤","author":"钱易","text":"清风习池上，落日岘山西。\n使君来问俗，听唱白铜鞮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦花","author":"钱易","text":"深溪高岸罩秋烟，飒飒江风向暮天。\n凝洁月华临静夜，一丛丛盖钓鱼船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕作","author":"钱易","text":"天上人间重此宵，新情旧恨两迢迢。\n汉宫露密罘罳冷，秦殿灯深羯鼓焦。\n香粉溟濛筛绮席，蛛丝千万络烟霄。\n牵牛何事劳乌鹊，不使虹蜺驾作桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"钱易","text":"天惨严霜厚，神清宿雨微。\n枝空蝉拟脱，巢冷燕谋归。\n白日莲塘梦，红纱水国衣。\n锦书知未了，轧轧弄鸣机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋夜守让南厅玩月","author":"钱易","text":"秋气元清切，明蟾千里心。\n金盘上河侧，玉水浸楼阴。\n闺怨有消歇，客愁无浅深。\n关山今夜里，星斗共沉沉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟张籍上裴晋公","author":"钱易","text":"午桥庄上千竿竹，绿野堂中白日春。\n富贵极来唯叹老，功名高后转轻身。\n严更未报皇城里，胜赏时游洛水滨。\n昨日庭趋三节度，淮西曾是执戈人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏华林书院","author":"钱易","text":"旌表华林盛，儒官寄翠微。\n科名新伯仲，孝行旧光辉。\n云影阴书幌，松花湿道衣。\n自惭方试吏，争得去忘机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南兵","author":"钱易","text":"曾见南兵苦，征辽事亦如。\n金疮寒长肉，纸甲雨生蛆。\n山小齑霜骨，河枯臛腐鱼。\n黎元无处哭，丁户日相疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张无梦归天台","author":"钱易","text":"暂谒明光拂斗槎，杖藜归去赤城霞。\n琳宫重启仙人室，金阙新辞太帝家。\n祇自运心奔白日，何须掷米作丹砂。\n云章赐重崆峒远，还向悬岑鍊五芽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归护国寺","author":"钱易","text":"拂衣台岭旧林泉，命服兰芽夺目鲜。\n一念不居常在定，十分无闷尽安禅。\n霜含庭柏依稀老，月到经窗暗澹圆。\n蠛枕沈迷难话别，半桥衰柳锁寒烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和人首夏池上雨中闻笛","author":"钱易","text":"朱华始沈泉，池塘恰雨天。\n鹭头飘雪暗，荷腹荡珠圆。\n风递谁家笛，声冲几里烟。\n拂波轻重起，隔树往来传。\n沥沥虽侵汉，遥遥已杂□。\n天龙吟转乐，石韵更相连。\n谩读襄王赋，虚誇子晋仙。\n宁同向散骑，肠断向漪涟。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳至玉津园赐宴","author":"钱易","text":"祓禊标春巳，歌时庆鲁雩。\n禁园宣密宴，玉馔赐天厨。\n班序参三殿，衣冠盛两都。\n云罍倾上席，宝马闹长衢。\n帝泽恩何重，春风节已徂。\n归来白虎殿，微咏共操觚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西游曲","author":"钱易","text":"花销秋老白日短，败红荒绿迷空馆。\n拟将清血洒昭陵，幽谷蛇啼半山晚。\n十年辞家勤献书，王孙不许延公车。\n江头祖庙祭无血，重门生草寒离离。\n我有黄金三尺剑，奸骨无痕古波艳。\n佩入函关无故人，玉握凋零七星暗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夏病中","author":"钱易","text":"抱病经清暑，空庭扫紫苔。\n花篱妨蝶过，桐井引禽来。\n徒有文园渴，更有漳浦才。\n可怜馀滞骨，无复动心灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟卢仝诗","author":"钱易","text":"门前飞杨花，屋后恶水鸣青蛙。\n案上两卷书，尧典与舜典，留与添丁作生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"览越僧诗集有寄","author":"钱易","text":"莫学江淹拟惠休，碧云才调已难酬。\n怀君知有关山梦，开卷如逢水石秋。\n不得归来作都讲，自惭名宦正悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦越州小江","author":"钱易","text":"越布缝单衾，灯青月黄浅。\n精魂度江水，适去无近远。\n湿沙平朔天，宿鸟踏古篆。\n巨潮淹积石，瘦白涩无藓。\n橹响期西陵，苍岑屏曲展。\n夙龄贱登临，今日生健羡。\n汀洲逢故妾，振袂指吴苑。\n向人呼旧官，血泣惭孤蹇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嵇康小舞词","author":"钱易","text":"薛九三十侍中郎，兰香花态生春堂。\n龙盘王气变秋雾，淮声哭月浮秋霜。\n宜城酒烟湿羁腹，与君强舞当时曲。\n玉树遗辞莫重听，黄尘染鬓无前绿。\n我闻襄阳白铜鞮，荒情古艳传幽悲。\n凄凉不抵亡国恨，尘中苦泪飞柔丝。\n洛阳公子擎银觞，跪奴和曲生辉光。\n茂陵旅梦无春草，彤管含羞裁短章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"温泉诗","author":"钱易","text":"悲哉天宝时，帝耄政不修。\n宠幸尊妇人，阴极阳已柔。\n外戚盛本枝，栉比封列侯。\n丞相大将军，备位甚悠悠。\n天下安既久，积渐力不周。\n车服金玉焕，黎庶饥寒愁。\n骊山温泉宫，昼幸与夜游。\n一游百司备，万费一日休。\n虽能心自快，化作神稷忧。\n国忠恣吞噬，林甫怀奸偷。\n胡雏据太原，钟鼓无计收。\n黄尘满长安，惨黩九庙羞。\n唐天未使绝，返正知疾瘳。\n自兹游赏地，荆棘生荒秋。\n旧物悉已废，蜘蛛挂重楼。\n览者咸寒心，一过三回头。\n因知帝王业，坚固宣鸿猷。\n岂可信嗜欲，侮弄生疮疣。\n雕墙峻宇诫，简牍况有由。\n翻思黍离章，续之应可仇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"钱易","text":"双蜂上帘额，独鹊袅庭柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62022,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"钱易","text":"子美无情甚，都官著意频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62023,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"钱易","text":"世上何人号最忙，紫微失去张君房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62024,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"钱易","text":"莫叹鬓如雪，且教心似灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62025,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"钱易","text":"绿章封事缄初启，青凤求凰尾乍开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62026,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"钱易","text":"好开今日太平基，万里山河归掌握。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62027,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"济源县裴公亭","author":"钱若水","text":"裴相亭成未退身，空烦舞袖与歌尘。\n至今亭下萧萧竹，似对秋风怨主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62028,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送杨大年知处州二首 其二","author":"钱若水","text":"汗简成惇史，分符别近班。\n仍闻栝苍郡，酷似武夷山。\n捲箔烟霞丽，登楼水石闲。\n二年弃官去，惟我独何颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62029,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送杨大年知处州二首 其一","author":"钱若水","text":"夫子厌承明，还求领郡行。\n两章干负扆，数刻对延英。\n岂独綵衣乐，兼为昼锦荣。\n圣朝循吏传，首得见君名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62030,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏华林书院","author":"钱若水","text":"居近华林对白云，义风深可羡人伦。\n儿孙尽得诗书力，门巷偏多车马尘。\n楼上落霞粘笔砚，池边怪石间松筠。\n乡闾岂独民迁善，阶砌无关鸟亦驯。\n朱实垂庭红橘熟，清香袭坐药畦春。\n他年好卜为邻住，悔葺吾庐洛水滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62031,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禁林宴会之什","author":"钱若水","text":"一夜春风满帝都，禁林清晓宴簪裾。\n玉堂乍到惊凡目，金锁徐开见御书。\n四字骊龙争夭矫，两篇琼树斗扶疏。\n词臣此会人应羡，圣主多才古不如。\n日上花砖帘捲后，柳遮铃索雨晴初。\n阁前吟罢先沈醉，忘却西垣有直庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62032,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"钱若水","text":"黼座劝觞钧乐逸，云章属韵待貂传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62033,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"钱若水","text":"三陪藻燕簪裾上，五对龙颜日月边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":62034,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]